Three possible solutions:
1. Collect the new stats in advance based on the new column type, and publish new stats and new schema version together;
2. Cast the prior stats data (TopN, Histogram) to the new column type directly;
3. After finishing DDL, the auto-analyze automatically collects the new stats immediately; (but this solution is not perfect, there is still a time window of stats-missing depending on how long the stats collection would take)
